-6 sm:text-base\">اكتشف رحلاتنا الراقية المصممة بعناية.</p><div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-3 sm:mt-10 sm:flex-row sm:gap-4\"><a href=\"/brochures/medya-travel-syria-journey-ar.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"w-full bg-gold px-8 py-3.5 text-center text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-luxury text-brand transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-bronze sm:w-auto sm:px-10 sm:py-4\">تحميل كتيب الرحلة</a><a class=\"w-full border border-white/20 px-8 py-3.5 text-center text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-luxury text-white transition-all duration-300 hover:border-gold hover:text-gold sm:w-auto sm:px-10 sm:py-4\" href=\"/ar/journeys/first-journey-to-syria/\">عرض برنامج الرحلة</a></div></div><div class=\"mt-14 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2\"><a class=\"group overflow-hidden border border-white/10 bg-charcoal\" href=\"/ar/journeys/first-journey-to-syria/\"><div class=\"relative min-h-72 overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"الرحلة الأولى إلى سوريا\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition duration-700 group-hover:scale-[1.03]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/syria/palmyra-columns.webp\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-brand via-brand/15 to-transparent\"></div><div class=\"absolute right-5 top-5 h-16 w-32\"><img alt=\"MEDYA TRAVEL\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-contain drop-shadow-[0_3px_8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.75)]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1nlA5g82W2baOf4FvFmvwOxuR6PI9ZRi1/view?usp=sharing\"/></div><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 p-7\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-gold\">الرحلات الحالية</p><h3 class=\"mt-3 font-serif text-3xl text-white\">الرحلة الأولى إلى سوريا</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-white/70\">7 أيام / 6 ليالٍ</p></div></div></a><a class=\"group overflow-hidden border border-white/10 bg-charcoal\" href=\"/ar/journeys/essential-spain/\"><div class=\"relative min-h-72 overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"إسبانيا الأساسية\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition duration-700 group-hover:scale-[1.03]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"https://iberica-travel.com/files/travel%20packages%202018/3.%20Andalusia%20and%20Levante/CityofArtsandSciencesValenciaTitle.jpg\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-brand via-brand/15 to-transparent\"></div><div class=\"absolute right-5 top-5 h-16 w-32\"><img alt=\"MEDYA TRAVEL\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-contain drop-shadow-[0_3px_8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.75)]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1nlA5g82W2baOf4FvFmvwOxuR6PI9ZRi1/view?usp=sharing\"/></div><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 p-7\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-gold\">الرحلات الحالية</p><h3 class=\"mt-3 font-serif text-3xl text-white\">إسبانيا الأساسية</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-white/70\">6 أيام / 5 ليالٍ</p></div></div></a></div><div class=\"mt-12 border-t border-white/10 pt-10 sm:mt-16 sm:pt-12\"><h3 class=\"text-center font-serif text-3xl text-white sm:text-4xl\">بروشورات إسبانيا</h3><div class=\"mt-7 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3\"><a href=\"/brochures/medya-travel-essential-spain-ar.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"group border border-white/10 bg-charcoal/80 p-6 transition hover:border-gold/60\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-gold\">M-101</p><h4 class=\"mt-3 font-serif text-2xl text-white\">إسبانيا الأساسية</h4><p class=\"mt-5 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-white/60 transition group-hover:text-gold\">فتح البروشور</p></a><a href=\"/brochures/medya-travel-andalusian-highlights-ar.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"group border border-white/10 bg-charcoal/80 p-6 transition hover:border-gold/60\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-gold\">M-102</p><h4 class=\"mt-3 font-serif text-2xl text-white\">أبرز معالم الأندلس</h4><p class=\"mt-5 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-white/60 transition group-hover:text-gold\">فتح البروشور</p></a><a href=\"/brochures/medya-travel-southern-spain-coast-ar.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"group border border-white/10 bg-charcoal/80 p-6 transition hover:border-gold/60\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-gold\">M-103</p><h4 class=\"mt-3 font-serif text-2xl text-white\">جنوب إسبانيا والساحل</h4><p class=\"mt-5 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-white/60 transition group-hover:text-gold\">فتح البروشور</p></a></div></div><div class=\"mx-auto mt-12 flex max-w-lg flex-col items-center gap-6 rounded-sm border border-white/10 bg-charcoal/70 p-6 backdrop-blur-sm sm:mt-16 sm:flex-row sm:gap-8 sm:p-8\"><div class=\"relative h-16 w-40 shrink-0 sm:h-20 sm:w-48\"><img alt=\"شعار شريكنا السياحي في سوريا\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-contain\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/lclxcm8g/image/upload/v1783899048/Screenshot_2026-07-12_190135_tlslpg.png\"/></div><p class=\"text-center text-sm leading-relaxed text-light-gray sm:text-start\">نعمل بالشراكة مع خبراء موثوقين داخل سوريا لضمان تنفيذ كل تفصيل في رحلتك بأعلى معايير الراحة والجودة والأصالة.</p></div></div></section><section id=\"about\" class=\"bg-charcoal py-20 sm:py-24 lg:py-32\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-10\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16\"><div class=\"relative mx-auto aspect-square w-full max-w-sm overflow-hidden rounded-full border-2 border-gold/30 sm:max-w-md\"><img alt=\"صورة مؤسس أو مؤسسة MEDYA TRAVEL\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/lclxcm8g/image/upload/v1783898973/ChatGPT_Image_Jul_10_2026_02_57_14_PM_cavnct.png\"/></div><div><p class=\"mb-3 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-gold sm:mb-4\">من نحن</p><h2 class=\"font-serif text-3xl text-white sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl\">معيار جديد للسفر إلى سوريا</h2><p class=\"mt-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-light-gray sm:mt-6 sm:text-base\">انطلقت MEDYA TRAVEL من رؤية واضحة: أن تُعاش سوريا كتجربة متكاملة، لا أن تُزار كوجهة عابرة. نصمم رحلات خاصة للمسافرين الذين يقدّرون الخصوصية والعمق الثقافي والراحة دون تنازلات.</p><p class=\"mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-light-gray sm:text-base\">يُصاغ كل برنامج بعناية شخصية، من الجولات التراثية في دمشق إلى عشاء الغروب على ساحل البحر المتوسط، بدقة تليق بتجربة سفر راقية وبدفء الضيافة السورية الأصيلة.</p><div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-col gap-4 border-t border-white/10 pt-8 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:gap-8\"><div class=\"relative flex h-16 w-16 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-full border border-gold/30\"><img alt=\"شعار الشريك السوري الرسمي\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/lclxcm8g/image/upload/v1783899048/Screenshot_2026-07-12_190135_tlslpg.png\"/></div><p class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-luxury text-light-gray\">الشريك الرسمي في سوريا</p></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"request\" class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-brand py-20 sm:py-24 lg:py-32\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute -right-36 top-20 h-80 w-80 rounded-full bg-gold/10 blur-[120px]\"></div><div class=\"relative mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-12 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.2fr] lg:px-10\"><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.26em] text-gold\">طلب رحلة</p><h2 class=\"mt-4 max-w-xl font-serif text-4xl leading-tight text-white sm:text-5xl\">أخبرنا كيف ترغب أن تكون رحلتك</h2><p class=\"mt-6 max-w-lg text-sm leading-8 text-light-gray sm:text-base\">املأ النموذج المختصر، وسيُفتح طلبك في واتساب جاهزًا لإرساله مباشرة إلى فريق الرحلات لدينا.</p></div><form class=\"grid gap-5 border border-white/10 bg-charcoal/80 p-5 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-sm sm:grid-cols-2 sm:p-8\"><label class=\"text-xs font-medium text-white/70\">الاسم الكامل<!-- --> *<input class=\"mt-2 min-h-12 w-full border border-white/15 bg-brand/60 px-4 text-sm text-white outline-none transition placeholder:text-white/25 focus:border-gold\" autoComplete=\"name\" value=\"\"/></label><label class=\"text-xs font-medium text-white/70\">البريد الإلكتروني<!-- --> *<input type=\"email\" class=\"mt-2 min-h-12 w-full border border-white/15 bg-brand/60 px-4 text-sm text-white outline-none transition placeholder:text-white/25 focus:border-gold\" autoComplete=\"email\" value=\"\"/></label><label class=\"text-xs font-medium text-white/70\">رقم الهاتف / واتساب<!-- --> *<input class=\"mt-2 min-h-12 w-full border border-white/15 bg-brand/60 px-4 text-sm text-white outline-none transition placeholder:text-white/25 focus:border-gold\" autoComplete=\"tel\" dir=\"ltr\" value=\"\"/></label><label class=\"text-xs font-medium text-white/70\">بلد الإقامة<!-- --> *<input class=\"mt-2 min-h-12 w-full border border-white/15 bg-brand/60 px-4 text-sm text-white outline-none transition placeholder:text-white/25 focus:border-gold\" autoComplete=\"country-name\" value=\"\"/></label><label class=\"text-xs font-medium text-white/70\">عدد المسافرين<!-- --> *<input type=\"number\" min=\"1\" max=\"50\" class=\"mt-2 min-h-12 w-full border border-white/15 bg-brand/60 px-4 text-sm text-white outline-none transition placeholder:text-white/25 focus:border-gold\" value=\"\"/></label><label class=\"text-xs font-medium text-white/70\">التاريخ المفضل للسفر<input type=\"date\" class=\"mt-2 min-h-12 w-full border border-white/15 bg-brand/60 px-4 text-sm text-white outline-none transition placeholder:text-white/25 focus:border-gold\" value=\"\"/></label><label class=\"text-xs font-medium text-white/70 sm:col-span-2\">رغباتك أو استفساراتك<textarea class=\"mt-2 min-h-12 w-full border border-white/15 bg-brand/60 px-4 text-sm text-white outline-none transition placeholder:text-white/25 focus:border-gold min-h-32 py-3\"></textarea></label><div class=\"sm:col-span-2\"><button type=\"submit\" class=\"min-h-13 w-full bg-gold px-7 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-brand transition hover:bg-bronze sm:w-auto\">إرسال طلب الرحلة</button><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-2xl text-[11px] leading-5 text-white/40\">لا تُخزّن بياناتك في الموقع، بل تُنقل إلى واتساب فقط عند إرسال الطلب.</p></div></form></div></section></main><footer id=\"book\" class=\"relative overflow-hidden border-t border-white/10 bg-brand py-14 sm:py-20\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute right-0 top-0 h-80 w-80 rounded-full bg-gold/5 blur-3xl\"></div><div class=\"relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-10\"><div class=\"grid gap-12 border-b border-white/10 pb-12 lg:grid-cols-[1.2fr_0.7fr_1.1fr]\"><div><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-4\" aria-label=\"MEDYA TRAVEL – الصفحة الرئيسية\" href=\"/ar/\"><span class=\"relative h-20 w-20 overflow-hidden rounded-full border border-gold/60 shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(199,156,89,0.2)]\"><img alt=\"MEDYA TRAVEL\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/lclxcm8g/image/upload/v1783941973/Gemini_Generated_Image_27jxkk27jxkk27jx_m7v3kj.png\"/></span><span><s